WEBVTT

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.210
Welcome home... Papa.

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.120
Awesome, awesome!

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:53.650
That's so cool!

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:59.390
It's the new overnight express, the Z101 Solar Rail!

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:05.300
Its first trip is this Saturday.

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.320
The tickets sold out in 30 minutes.

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:10.360
How very scary!

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:14.200
Guys really seem to like trains and cars.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:18.780
Mama told me that they'll like childish things no matter how old they are.

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:20.700
Yeah, that's right!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:21.850
Yep.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:23.450
Hey, did you guys know?

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:27.880
This new overnight express has 12 two-floor cabins.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:34.880
Underneath the 12th cabin, right under floorboard E26, there is a 520 horsepower diesel engine.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.430
You sure know a lot.

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:43.220
And the train is equipped like a five-star hotel.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:46.650
The food is prepared by chefs from famous restaurants.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:52.100
So you can have high class steaks!?

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:55.070
Ah, probably...

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:58.440
I didn't know Onpu-chan would know all about trains.

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:01.820
Wait, maybe you're a train maniac!

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.950
A famous chef's steak...

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:16.320
I Want to Meet Papa!
The Dream Aboard the Overnight Express.

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:21.810
"The Bridge of Happiness?"

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:22.550
Yes.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:26.820
It's a famous work that was made into a drama three years ago.

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:30.940
You'll be auditioning for the role of Akane, the main character's younger sister.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:42.730
Akane's parts are difficult, but I'm sure you can learn a lot from her.

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:45.220
Really?

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:49.950
And Akane's brother will be played by that Matsuzawa Akihiro-kun.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:51.790
Eh? You mean Makki?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:53.390
Yep.

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:54.540
I'll do it, I'll do it!

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:58.640
I'll definitely pass the audition for Makki!

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:00.000
That's my good child.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:04.240
Ah, that must be a message from Papa.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:09.970
It's decided. I'll be the first conductor for the new overnight express.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.720
I've bought tickets for you and Mama.

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:14.440
I hope you'll be looking forward to it.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.940
Yes! Papa's the conductor!

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.460
The ceremony for the train's first trip is on Saturday night.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:25.600
That's bad... I have an important meeting regarding your work that day.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:30.380
No... Papa will be sad if you don't go.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:33.580
Onpu'll go by herself then, okay?

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:38.460
All right, go for my sake and see how Papa is doing.

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:40.080
Okay!

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:46.370
Onpu-chan's father is a train driver.

00:04:46.370 --> 00:04:49.040
Yeah, Majo Rika told us.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.890
Plush-chan... Plush-chan...

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:51.900
Eh?

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:58.910
Onpu-chan.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:03.120
Onpu-chan, don'tcha have work today?

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.350
What are you doing?

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:08.400
You girls... Hey, listen.

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:13.120
My papa was chosen to be the first driver of that new overnight express.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.100
That new overnight express?

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.080
Wow! That's so cool!

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.600
Yep, it's very cool.

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:23.070
Papa's going to mail me tickets.

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.260
And... I'll be able to ride it!

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.260
I want to ride it too!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.560
Really?

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:30.220
That's awesome.

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:37.940
I haven't seen Papa in three months, since he's always busy traveling to train stations.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:44.160
He comes home sometimes, but I haven't been able to see him because of work.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:46.280
Ah... I'm looking forward to Saturday.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.530
See you later.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.380
Bye-bye.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:52.950
I think Onpu-chan's a bit different from usual.

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:56.960
She's never talked about herself like that.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.920
But I feel like she's very happy 'bout all this!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:02.380
Yeah!

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:04.630
Pop is too!

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:15.020
Big brother, wait.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.060
Big brother, don't go!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.050
I-I'm sorry.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:24.940
I'm too nervous...

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.210
Wait.

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:32.920
Big brother, don't go!

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.750
Don't leave me all alone!

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:42.380
Don't... leave me all alone.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:47.690
Onpu-chan.

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:50.220
Oh my, you're making me embarrassed.

00:06:51.030 --> 00:06:51.910
Why?

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.480
I think you're doing pretty well.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:00.480
I'm Morino Karen.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.410
I'm so happy that you complimented me.

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:07.650
But I'm very nervous.

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:11.970
I get all stiff in front of the camera.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:18.960
But I must act in this drama, I practiced so hard for it...

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:21.920
Are you Makki's fan too?

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.310
Eh? No...

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:27.000
I've always wanted to be in this drama.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:28.250
But...

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:33.970
I enter every audition with the notion that I'll get in.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.360
This time is no different.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:38.240
See you later.

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:45.320
I must win...

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:51.700
Audition numbers 50 to 60, please come to the main hall.

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:55.880
The tickets!

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:58.580
Papa's train tickets came!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:03.690
Yes, this is Segawa, thank you for all that you've done.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:06.600
Yes, thank you very much.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.940
Yes, yes.

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.730
You've passed the first run.

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:12.620
They want us to come back.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:14.780
Yes!

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.640
Onpu-chan, wait up!

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:21.600
What is it?

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:26.500
Hey, hey, I heard you got into that drama with Makki in it.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.160
I read it in the newspaper this morning.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:31.540
I really want Makki's autograph.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:33.570
Could you get it for me?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.430
I haven't gotten the role yet.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:39.490
The last audition is this Saturday.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:41.500
Eh? I see.

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:43.420
Saturday?

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:46.700
Onpu-chan, isn't your dad's train coming that day?

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:48.880
It departs at 6 PM.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.170
I'll be done with my audition by then, so I'm okay.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:57.140
We'll cheer for you, Onpu-chan, so you gotta win, okay?

00:08:57.710 --> 00:08:58.600
Yeah!

00:08:59.400 --> 00:09:00.100
Do your best.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.090
Thank you, everyone.

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:05.620
Oh yeah, the last audition will be broadcast.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:08.520
I'll invite you all to the set.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:09.890
Really?

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:11.010
That sounds fun.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.030
I'll go, I'll go! We'll all go!

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:21.410
So many people here...

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:25.370
It's Makki's sister's role, so people want to see who it is.

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:28.260
I want Onpu-chan to get accepted.

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:28.690
Yeah.

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:32.240
But I hope she doesn't use magic again.

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:33.850
I guess I'm a bit worried fer that.

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:35.590
Yeah, me too.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.050
No way!

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:02.100
Onpu-chan.

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.700
Um... You are...?

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.620
I'm Morino Karen.

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:18.020
I took your words to heart, so here I am.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:18.630
Thank you.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.800
Eh?

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:26.140
But this is the last audition, so I can't lose.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:27.700
Me too.

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:29.600
But...

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:47.640
I...

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:50.460
I think I'm the same as my father.

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:57.550
My father got nervous easily.

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:05.240
And he always failed auditions, so he couldn't get a decent role.

00:11:06.660 --> 00:11:08.350
When that happened, he'd always...

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:22.590
My father would always carry me to see the sunset from the bridge.

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:31.670
Your father's back must be very warm.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.700
Yeah...

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:44.010
But... Three years ago, he got a chance to be in the drama version of The Bridge of Happiness.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:47.120
He was overjoyed.

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:48.700
But...

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:53.130
He got sick and was bedridden before the shooting began.

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.020
And after that, he went to Heaven.

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:04.110
That's why I must pass this audition and act in The Bridge of Happiness.

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:07.280
I must make my father's dream come true!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.550
Big brother...

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:26.420
No matter where you are, this bridge will connect us.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:27.180
That's why!

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:28.890
That's why...

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:35.190
I will always wait for you, on this bridge...

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.270
That's my Onpu-chan.

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.800
She doesn't need to use magic here.

00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:46.950
Yeah.

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.080
Onpu-chan, that was awesome!

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:50.980
Onpu-chan.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.040
Mama!

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:55.650
I have to go to a meeting now.

00:12:55.650 --> 00:12:57.040
Are you going to be okay by yourself?

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:01.070
Yes, I'll go see Papa afterwards.

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:02.460
Okay, do your best.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:04.970
You'll definitely get Akane's role.

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:17.520
Karen-chan...

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.440
Now, last but not least, Morino Karen-san!

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:24.990
Morino-san! Please get on stage!

00:13:57.240 --> 00:13:58.730
My lines...

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.290
I can't remember them.

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:36.310
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:39.300
Cure Karen-chan's nervousness!

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.760
Was that magic just now?

00:14:48.760 --> 00:14:51.220
She knows she can't use magic to alter people's thoughts...

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:52.870
What is that girl thinkin'?

00:14:56.820 --> 00:14:59.920
Big brother, is it true?

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:05.410
I'll really be left all alone?

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:08.590
Look at me!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:09.470
Big brother!

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:13.790
No matter where you go, I will wait for you on this bridge.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.740
I ran out of magic spheres.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:22.600
But it's fine, I can still make it to Papa's train.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:31.990
So who will be Makki's younger sister?

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:41.340
After Segawa Onpu-san and Morino Karen-san audition again, we will make our decision.

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:54.820
I won't make Papa's train like this.

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:01.720
Look! That's the train that Papa's driving!

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:04.500
I can't see it! I can't see it!

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:06.880
Here.

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.030
Onpu, can you see it?

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:15.570
Papa...

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:19.790
Onpu-chan.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:25.580
It's like a dream, being able to challenge you.

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:28.050
I'll do my best.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:31.920
I will definitely get chosen.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.640
I hope she won't use magic again.

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:40.920
There are horrible consequences for that kind of magic.

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:44.850
Majo Rika also said that her charm won't work every time.

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:45.350
Yeah.

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:56.840
Big brother, you liar.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.620
Big brother, is it really true?

00:17:03.420 --> 00:17:06.500
Are you really leaving me all alone?

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:15.980
Look at me!

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:19.390
Why...

00:17:21.630 --> 00:17:22.930
Big brother...

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:26.210
You promised me that you would definitely come back.

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:26.730
So why?

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:29.480
But you have to live.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:34.440
Inside my heart... forever.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.920
Just like that sunset we saw on this bridge.

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:39.980
Forever...

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:46.190
This bridge connects the both of us.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:46.830
That's why...!

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.750
I'll always wait for you.

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:52.710
On this bridge.

00:18:05.220 --> 00:18:09.610
The role of Akane in The Bridge of Happiness will be Morino Karen-san!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.200
Congratulations, Karen-chan.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:18.570
Papa's train...

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:22.880
She didn't use magic that time.

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:25.520
But she did use it earlier.

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:26.820
What a mystery.

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:29.000
Oh no!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.790
Onpu-chan's papa's train!

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:33.380
She won't make it.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.810
I can't make it.

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:01.510
Ah! Onpu-chan!

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:03.380
What're ya doin' here!?

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:06.790
If you use magic, you can make it to your dad's train!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.350
I can't use magic right now.

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.770
I'm out of magic spheres.

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:19.070
Then that magic from earlier...

00:19:21.320 --> 00:19:23.510
What did you cast!?

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:26.970
I cured Karen-chan's nervousness.

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:29.520
Then you helped her...

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:30.620
Yes.

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.420
We must do something.

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:35.260
Just leave it to us!

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:36.110
Get to the roof!

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.940
Onpu-chan, fly towards the station!

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:45.880
Okay.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:54.620
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:01.220
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:20:03.590 --> 00:20:06.550
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:19.020
Magical Stage!

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:27.580
Let Onpu-chan make it to her father's overnight express!

00:21:01.500 --> 00:21:03.680
I'm sorry, Papa.

00:21:21.060 --> 00:21:22.580
Your daughter is here.

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:25.760
Onpu.

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:32.540
Papa's so cool.

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:37.850
Thank you, Doremi-chan, Hadzuki-chan, Ai-chan.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.110
We did it!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:47.930
Yep.

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:49.030
Alright!

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:04.860
The level 1 exam is in Misora City.

00:22:04.860 --> 00:22:06.860
We hafta use magic to help other people.

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:09.310
We can't have our cover blown.

00:22:09.310 --> 00:22:11.510
We must receive the thanks of others by using magic.

00:22:11.510 --> 00:22:12.580
That's too easy, too easy.

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:13.990
No! You can't! That's forbidden!

00:22:13.990 --> 00:22:16.960
Ya can't use magic to alter people's thoughts.

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:17.750
Okay, okay.

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:22.180
Using magic to help others... I think I'm becoming a real witch!

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:23.660
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.660 --> 00:22:25.430
The Final Witch Apprentice Exam.

00:22:25.430 --> 00:22:28.250
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
